('pma-non-verbal-intelligence-test-1',38,'pma-pattern-completion','The number of small markers changes 1, 3, 2, 4. If the pattern alternates adding two then subtracting one, how many are next?', 'MEDIUM','MEDIUM','Three','Four','Five','Six','A','The changes are +2, −1, +2, so the next change is −1. Four markers become three.',pg_temp.pma_visual(ARRAY['dot-center','dot-nw+dot-ne+dot-se','dot-nw+dot-se','dot-nw+dot-ne+dot-se+dot-sw','?'],ARRAY['dot-nw+dot-ne+dot-se','dot-nw+dot-ne+dot-se+dot-sw','dot-nw+dot-se','dot-center'])),
