('pma-non-verbal-intelligence-test-1',43,'pma-pattern-completion','A large circle contains a centered small square; next a large square contains a centered small diamond. Which figure follows the same outer/inner change?', 'HARD','LOW','Large circle with small square','Large diamond with small circle','Large square with small circle','Large diamond with small square','B','The outer shape changes circle→square→diamond, while the inner changes square→diamond→circle. The next is a large diamond with a small circle.',pg_temp.pma_visual(ARRAY['circle+small-square','square+small-diamond','?'],ARRAY['circle+small-square','diamond+small-circle','square+small-circle','diamond+small-square'])),
