('pma-mathematical-series-test',2,'pma-square-cube-pattern','Complete the sequence: 120, 119, 115, 106, 90, ?', 'MEDIUM','HIGH','64','65','66','67','B','The amounts subtracted are 1², 2², 3², and 4². Subtract 5²=25 from 90 to get 65.','null'::jsonb),
('pma-mathematical-series-test',3,'pma-square-cube-pattern','What comes next: 1, 8, 27, 64, 125, ?', 'EASY','HIGH','196','205','216','225','C','These are cubes of consecutive integers: 1³, 2³, 3³, 4³, 5³. The next is 6³=216.','null'::jsonb),
